-challenge-27.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-28.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-29.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-3.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-4.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-5.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-6.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-7.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-8.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-challenge-9.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-claude-reflection-2.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-claude.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-10.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-11.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-12.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-13.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-14.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-15.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-16.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-17.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-18.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-19.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-2.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-20.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-21.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-22.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-23.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-24.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-25.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-26.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex-27.md\n?? clean-arch/step1-unfiled-2026-11-08/council/mu-codex